{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A serious adventure. <i>A serious goal.</i> <strong>A serious game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It matters not that a terrifying evil has descended on this world. It matters not that entire towns are being wiped out on a daily basis. It matters not that the promised saviour has yet to show, and hopelessness is spreading across the land.\u00a0 Because your washing machine is busted, and you <i>really</i> need some clean clothes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you complete the journey to your parents' house, and get them to do your laundry? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this super-deadly-serious adventure, meeting friends, exploring towns, and trying to avoid the battle to save the realm. Because you\u2019re no hero, and you simply don\u2019t have time for that nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Questing is an action-adventure-RPG, inspired by classics like Link to the Past and Chrono Trigger, with a modern, satirical twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a world of odd characters, dangerous perils, and intriguing secrets on your journey:</strong><br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087670/extras/SteamGif1.gif?t=1746572264\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle the strange, angry monsters that plague the land:</strong><br><br><br><strong> </strong>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087670/extras/SteamGif2.gif?t=1746572264\" /><strong> </strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve terribly tricky puzzles along the way:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/